<Layout title="Drylining Peebles | Partition Walls &amp; Ceilings Contractors" description="Professional drylining contractors in Peebles. Expert partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard installation for Peebles, Scottish Borders, and the wider TD15 postcode region. Free quotes." canonical="/areas/peebles/" schema={schema}>
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);overflow:hidden;"> <img src="/images/hero-main.jpg" alt="Drylining services in Peebles and the Scottish Borders" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.25;"> <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;"> <nav style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);margin-bottom:12px;"> <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Home</a> / <a href="/areas/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Areas</a> / <span style="color:#ffffff;">Drylining in Peebles</span> </nav> <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.15;">Drylining in Peebles</h1> <p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">CSCS-accredited drylining contractors delivering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard across Peebles, Scottish Borders, and the wider TD15 postcode region.</p> </div> </section> <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;"> <div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);"> <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Drylining Peebles provides drylining, partition walls, and suspended ceilings across Peebles (TD15), Scottish Borders, and the wider area. Experienced with Borders townhouse conversions, rural property refurbishments, and new residential developments.</p> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Drylining Services in Peebles</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Peebles is the capital of the Scottish Borders, situated approximately 30 miles south of Edinburgh city centre along the River Tweed. The TD15 postcode covers the historic burgh town centre with its distinctive 18th and 19th-century architecture, surrounding residential areas, and the wider Tweeddale region. Peebles has a population of around 9,000 and is one of the Scottish Borders' most popular towns, known for its riverside walks, the Tweed Valley Railway, and its role as a hub for outdoor enthusiasts and retirees. As a popular destination for second-home buyers and remote workers commuting to Edinburgh, Peebles has seen steady residential development alongside ongoing preservation and refurbishment of its heritage property stock. The town's position at the heart of the Tweeddale valley creates consistent demand for quality drylining services across the Borders area.</p> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The area offers a distinctive mix of projects for our drylining team — from the careful internal refurbishment of listed townhouses in Peebles' historic centre to new build residential developments in the surrounding Tweeddale villages. We cover the entire TD15 postcode and surrounding Scottish Borders areas, serving everything from single-room domestic projects in period properties to larger commercial fit-outs along the town centre and countryside properties. All work is carried out to Scottish Building Standards compliant with all relevant sections.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">What We Do in Peebles</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our Peebles crew handles everything from historic townhouse conversions to rural property refurbishments — covering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and fire-rated wall systems across the TD15 postcode and Scottish Borders.</p> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><strong>Historic townhouse drylining</strong> — Internal wall insulation, room conversions, and partition walls in Peebles' listed 18th and 19th-century townhouses along the High Street and River Tweed</li> <li><strong>Rural property drylining</strong> — Internal wall insulation, room conversions, and partition walls in rural Borders properties and farm buildings across Tweeddale</li> <li><strong>Commercial fit-outs</strong> — Office refurbs, retail units, hospitality venues, and cafe conversions along Peebles town centre and the Tweed Valley</li> <li><strong>Fire-rated walls</strong> — Multi-storey residential and commercial buildings requiring Scottish Building Standards Section 2 (Fire) compliance</li> <li><strong>Suspended ceilings</strong> — Commercial premises, offices, and residential properties across the Scottish Borders</li> <li><strong>Acoustic partitions</strong> — Residential properties, mixed-use developments, and holiday lets in Peebles and surrounding Borders areas</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Areas of Peebles We Cover</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li>Peebles town centre (TD15) — High Street, South Street, Market Street</li> <li>River Tweed and Eildons area</li> <li>Teviot Street and Westport</li> <li>Tweeddale Terrace and residential areas</li> <li>Stobo and Innerleithen — 15 minutes via A708</li> <li>Selkirk — 20 minutes via A708</li> <li>Town Yetholm and Lauder — 15 minutes via A6093</li> <li>Tweeddale villages generally</li> <li>Scottish Borders area generally</li> <li>Tweed Valley properties</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Peebles Building Regulations &amp; Planning</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Peebles falls under <strong>Scottish Borders Council</strong> for building standards and planning. The town centre contains numerous Category A, B, and C listed buildings, particularly properties along the High Street and River Tweed that are within conservation areas. Many period properties are also within the <strong>Peebles Conservation Area</strong>, meaning internal structural alterations may require additional consent. We work closely with clients, architects, and the council's building standards department to ensure every project — from a simple room partition in a historic townhouse to a rural property conversion — is fully compliant with Scottish Building Standards and any additional conservation requirements.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Us for Peebles Projects</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">As an Edinburgh-based drylining team, we have extensive experience working across the Scottish Borders, including Peebles, Innerleithen, and Selkirk. We understand the unique character of Peebles — from its historic town centre to the wider Tweeddale valley and surrounding rural properties. Our crew is familiar with Scottish Building Standards and the particular requirements of working in the Borders' conservation areas and rural properties. Whether you need drylining for a historic townhouse conversion, a rural property refurbishment, or a commercial fit-out, our team delivers quality work on time and within budget.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Related Services</h2> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <a href="/services/partition-walls/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Partition Walls</a> <a href="/services/fire-rated-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Fire-Rated Drylining</a> <a href="/services/acoustic-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Acoustic Drylining</a> <a href="/services/refurbishment-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Refurbishment Drylining</a> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Nearby Areas</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><a href="/areas/edinburgh/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Edinburgh</a> — 30 minutes via A708</li> <li><a href="/areas/innerleithen/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Innerleithen</a> — 15 minutes via A708</li> <li><a href="/areas/selkirk/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Selkirk</a> — 20 minutes via A708</li> <li><a href="/areas/lauder/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Lauder</a> — 20 minutes via A6093</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Get a Free Peebles Quote</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem;">We offer free, no-obligation site visits and written quotes for all drylining projects across Peebles. Call us or fill in our quick form.</p> <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;"> <a href="/get-